<title>USA: PSC president to leave.</title>
<headline>PSC president to leave.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSC Inc said on Friday that John O'Brien, president of the company, has decided not to extend his employment agreement with the company beyond January 12, 1997.  </p>
<p>The company said that as previously announced, Robert Strandberg recently joined PSC as executive vice president and will now assume operational responsibility for the Rochester and Eugene manufacturing and engineering functions in addition to his other responsibilities.</p>
</text>
